  "package_id": "singer-orbit-blocking",
  "formal_scope": "Lean 4.35.0 models PG(2,13) with Mathlib's projectivization of F₁₃³ and proves that the Singer cycle has order 183, that its subgroup H of order three fixes no point, that the 21-point witness is an H-invariant minimal blocking set with largest line intersection five, the reduction of every H-invariant set to 61 orbit conditions, and the nonexistence of a solution with intersections at most four, by a kernel-checked search with a soundness proof; the main theorem is IsLeast admissibleCaps 5. The conjugacy of all fixed-point-free subgroups of order three is conventional.",
